      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that your absence would bring relief to everyone is a heavy and understandable thought when you are this tired. Your pain is so deep that the idea of stopping it feels like the only logical solution, but that is the weight of depression speaking, not the truth of your worth. Please know that the \"weight\" you feel is a symptom of suffering, and that suffering can be lifted, even if it feels impossible right now. Reach out to emergency services immediately; let them help you carry this load.",
